# Commit and push when the change is done

Canonical for this repo. Desk workspace copy: `desk/.cursor/rules/commit-push-after-changes.mdc`.

改完并验证后立刻 `git commit` 并 `git push origin master`，不要等开发者再说一次「提交 / 推送」。主干规则仍见 `armada-trunk.mdc`。

```text
❌ 功能已可用还把 diff 留着等下一句「帮我提交」
❌ 把无关脏文件塞进这一笔
❌ --no-verify；force push master
```

```text
✅ 验证绿 → commit → git push origin master
✅ 开发者点名「先别推」才停在本地
```
